      "comment": "ZINFANDEL STAR (1) was never in contention last time at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (30.55) beating Halfeti in a Grade 6 on October 22. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and looks hard to stop. ATTICA BLUE (4) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (25.77) at Shepparton. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Bold showing expected. MESSINA MISS (6) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 9 lengths at this track in a handy 34.53 beating Zinfandel Buck. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Can make it back-to-back wins. LAVENDER LANE (2) can sneak into the finish.",
